flowchart TB
  Upload[Browser uploads image] --> Guards[Check trusted origin, file presence, and 10 MB limit]
  Guards --> Mime[Inspect magic bytes and filename extension]
  Mime --> Format{JPEG, PNG, or WebP?}
  Format -->|no| Reject[Reject upload]

  Format -->|yes| ModelSharp[Sharp: crop to 224 x 224, remove alpha, convert to sRGB]
  ModelSharp --> Tensor[Normalize pixels into a 1 x 3 x 224 x 224 NCHW tensor]
  Tensor --> ONNX[MobileNetV2 inference with ONNX Runtime]
  ONNX --> Score[Softmax logits and sum five ImageNet cat classes]
  Score --> Cat{Combined score at least 0.20?}
  Cat -->|no| Reject

  Cat -->|yes| UUID[Generate UUID storage key]
  UUID --> DeliverySharp[Sharp: honour orientation and encode WebP]
  DeliverySharp --> Variants[300 px thumbnail at quality 80 and 1200 x 1200 full image at quality 85]
  Variants --> Volume[(Uploads volume)]
  Volume --> Database[(SQLite stores generated paths)]
  Database --> Redirect[HTMX redirect to updated leaderboard]

  Guards -. validation failure .-> Reject
  DeliverySharp -. processing failure .-> Cleanup[Delete partial generated files]
  Database -. insert failure .-> Cleanup